---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Services — Rezoning, Subdivisions & Land Use Applications"
  description="Full range of town planning services. Rezoning, subdivisions, departures, title deed removal, development reports and more."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero" style="min-height:50vh">
    <div class="hero-image" style="background: url('/hero-bg.jpg') center/cover no-repeat"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content" style="padding-bottom:4rem">
      <div class="hero-label">Expertise</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Services</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Every service needed to take a property from constrained to approved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- All services -->
  <section style="padding:6rem 0">
    <div class="wrap">

      <!-- Split: Rezoning -->
      <div class="split-section" id="rezoning">
        <div class="split-image" style="background: url('/images/img-3129839.jpg') center/cover no-repeat"></div>
        <div class="split-text">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">Rezoning</h3>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1rem">Change the use rights of a property. Whether you need to convert agricultural land to residential, or commercial to mixed-use &mdash; we handle the full application.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1rem">Rezoning applications typically involve public participation, traffic impact studies, and environmental assessments. We coordinate all specialist inputs.</p>
          <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)">Timeline: 6&ndash;18 months depending on municipality</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Split: Subdivisions -->
      <div class="split-section" id="subdivisions" style="flex-direction:row-reverse">
        <div class="split-image" style="background: url('/images/img-7937283.jpg') center/cover no-repeat"></div>
        <div class="split-text">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">Subdivisions &amp; Consolidations</h3>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1rem">Divide land into multiple erven, or consolidate several properties into one. We handle the cadastral, engineering and planning requirements.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1rem">From a simple two-portions subdivision to complex estate layouts &mdash; every application is built on a thorough understanding of the Spatial Development Framework.</p>
          <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)">Includes sectional title schemes</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Split: Departures -->
      <div class="split-section" id="departures">
        <div class="split-image" style="background: url('/images/img-30132298.jpg') center/cover no-repeat"></div>
        <div class="split-text">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">Departures</h3>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1rem">Relaxations on building lines, height restrictions, coverage, floor area ratio and parking requirements. Every municipality has different zoning scheme regulations.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1rem">We work closely with architects to prepare motivation reports that demonstrate why the departure is justified and how it won't negatively impact neighbours.</p>
          <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)">Timeline: 3&ndash;6 months</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card grid: remaining services -->
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:0.5px;margin-top:0.5px">
        <div class="split-text" id="title-deed">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Title Deed Removal</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem">Remove restrictive conditions limiting development potential. Historical conditions often no longer align with current spatial planning.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-text" id="development">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Development Reports</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem">Know what your property can become. Zoning compliance certificates, development potential assessments, and pre-purchase due diligence.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-text" id="consent-use">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Consent Use</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem">Secondary use rights &mdash; guest houses, home offices, second dwellings. Conditional approval from the municipality.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-text" id="spatial">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Spatial Planning</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem">Strategic land use planning. Site development plans, layout plans, and precinct-level spatial frameworks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-text" id="applications">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Land Use Applications</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem">SPLUMA-compliant applications. All categories of land development as defined by the Spatial Planning and Land Use Management Act.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-text" id="heritage">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Heritage Planning</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem">Heritage impact assessments and applications in heritage-sensitive areas. Stellenbosch, Franschhoek, and Cape Winelands expertise.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-text" id="township">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Township Establishment</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem">Create new townships from undeveloped land. Full engineering services coordination and environmental authorisation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="split-text" id="removal">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem">Restrictive Title Removal</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.875rem">Remove or amend conditions in title deeds that restrict land use, building lines, or development rights.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <hr class="section-divider">
  <section style="padding:6rem 0;text-align:center">
    <div class="narrow">
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="text-align:center">Not sure what you need?</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:2.5rem">
        We offer a free initial assessment to identify which application your property requires.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Get a free assessment</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
